creative-writer bundles third-party data and code:

- compromise (https://github.com/spencermountain/compromise) — MIT License.
- Concreteness norms from Brysbaert, Warriner & Kuperman (2014), "Concreteness
  ratings for 40 thousand generally known English word lemmas", Behavior
  Research Methods 46, 904–911 — CC-BY 4.0. Source file in data/, bundled
  subset generated by scripts/build-concreteness.mjs.
